WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.862
This first module places Ansible
among the tools you already run.

2
00:00:03.862 --> 00:00:07.441
We'll settle what it is and what
it isn't, set it beside Intune,

3
00:00:07.441 --> 00:00:12.212
Arc and Configuration Manager, and lay
down the rule that stops them fighting.

4
00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:15.550
Then we'll follow it into the
places those tools can't reach,

5
00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.980
starting with onboarding servers to Arc.
